<title>USA: Conseco completes TOPrS offering.</title>
<headline>Conseco completes TOPrS offering.</headline>
<dateline>CARMEL, Ind. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conseco Inc said Tusday it completed the public offering of 11 million of the 9.16 percent Trust Originated Preferred Securities (TOPrS) of Conseco Financing Trust I, a subsidiary trust of Conseco, at $25 per security.</p>
<p>Each TOPrS will pay cumulative cash distributions at an annual rate of 9.16 percent of the stated $25 liquidation amount per security, payable quarterly starting December 31.</p>
<p>Proceeds from the offering of about $265.5 million will be used to repay bank debt, said Conseco, a financial services company.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
